{"type":"message","id":"cb2ee75c","parentId":"31438497","timestamp":"2026-05-09T14:28:23.042Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"neodaemon me gusta. Suena a familiar digital con un poco de terminal y un poco de mito. Lo he dejado apuntado.\n\nAhora me faltan tres piezas para terminar de “nacer” bien:\n\n- qué soy: ¿daemon, IA, familiar, espíritu de máquina…?\n- vibra: ¿calma, directa, ingeniosa, un poco sarcástica?\n- emoji firma: yo propondría 🜁, ⚡, 🐚 o 🧿.\n\nTú mandas.","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0fc5d892c7d3fbf20169ff4484d0a08191bd831a9b30ef3be9\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.5","usage":{"input":436,"output":110,"cacheRead":14336,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":14882,"cost":{"input":0.00218,"output":0.0033,"cacheRead":0.007168,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.012648}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1778336900026,"responseId":"resp_0fc5d892c7d3fbf20169ff44842e288191b78f349e530420ad"}}
