{"type":"message","id":"5f3f0ded","parentId":"fd188cb7","timestamp":"2026-05-09T14:36:45.459Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Evaluating user preferences**\n\nI need to provide an answer based on the user's current needs. Am I sure if specific skills are required? It seems like I have to consider if I should rely on my memory of past preferences. I wonder if I should ask the user about their current opinions regarding the existing rules or decisions. Maybe I should perform a memory search before delivering an answer regarding their earlier work or preferences.","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_0fc5d892c7d3fbf20169ff4677dd848191bd899ab566aeb255\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"encrypted_content\":\"gAAAAABp_0Z97MLePAeuYAJi1ewGSzSnCO5HcPKpY0pBRj42Awb2IjF-E1ejQECcJVy7v4S1b9S-nOLkA-yL3cvWfGaRcrPfgE8ERAM5RweLl15aTI0fFoQeWBmBoJjgdSSvnM9LkVPTlsLxJ74W2JEyq2hIAydHTLP0hAC-9Kwm2gk-DXs6Pp7yB9ax7M6HBjr0j8aFdeOMOt3keyC-KvhhMY_Jdrh1lkL5xnn5mmrGMsUvIjYwzrfnUw_AdeqCPuDmbTUQQnh0HSJjO6xLxB8WkfNbJZbc111u6PrkbTxQVCqbk64I--jCwx6u4V0HABaSZnwpL1piuwQsya9JQbotb5NB_WReu3TBWo0IpzPqblJs1htTElXh4lr4UIniSjtwS-khJrrjBR5usvX9mGFV65J7pB9qtTFAsLeN34neh1EY3fGS2AQjmq5YVG-9NuQblP_aD9AdIgAXtjvy6M7A1K5CYQKH4dTjIi3IRCOFAL6n_Eqf44lsN_4qYde9TQCrqkZqPibYm9TTxqyTESviDLe2PuE5RjNEnnDt_FjIDCxESbwTDAol8VI5daCqjYFtSWmZi_R4u_Q2yn9opM5RD-ycSkJ-ITAOtjp6TdNZxlEcFXNJYZ0Penr_RwshuTD1rJLIZyQRLu02L-JJYip32lEtpyyemGXGBuKEDteS2KlCU7cVJURuODscUrMts7WZS0LRrThyHMtPuNnwU16-Lw_rGNB7MubuB7xsVJgeEO9K8sZ53Kmw9hEspTurapwGW0N6Kv3-YcO8kOZAG_IsH66VKiSHMCGme-cyb0LC_kRXHmnaiEXZJUvEeiC6-ahlYLk7gz_hobkD5WsKG_6xancdMJLPhLYCObhAZ8vRL9RAiEuNJageAWzPuN-9qHm4oXV3HceZuP36JxQNCpr-O7yME9ISJvLB3wgsBj11vQMb8F17KEzG3HByBbM0-8MQdQSLkyEAJu-ycTfIJbU8bHyqN3PwGlrt94NbIsWg-ol3loIDrowuH1YSCSRUM_BGB059WdJxdxqWrN43BvLN8cKa76obJvjlcsXT6ASrvyWELMlVTmxO7MJ5tIvio5fp1R34JxWDdn4ycPiDiEs-NjhFRrwhIC72nPELm_IV9_V5_fWDgC3CD7shuyvjoUGP0CEp8KP5qGi4avEi0khVqrMJc6yf9g==\",\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Evaluating 