QSLwudCizmQKAB8Gljzx18PjOlbwSu-HcmIda3mlfT79OSkd1mIhTGCU39UWj8KzZjoxZ-KvQQ2Vf3heerey6QXqtwWAlSPjv0vPfsM8aIJXYr9nd9a6O_CBeOdRJnKmSw0Er2NKYWZvLbNRFEFR3bjU5GRWX_nnXMuNwzLpuLTRnYUP7W-IDfZ17ynC97wshc7wqAQHDB0F__y88ZOQ3zBgURmwkppn-sMR6EiE1QORYHFZ_2OvHhcRy3m2nnvQpenNZGwO0bVGtpPc01_oN-2yPNVScxI2BxJniu2UrE2Lp8U1CY7TpCkm5h76gfKPykj-ExEaByeMofex05Zdg2JvTIVtSs2p-69Mm5xAhCyMnTcIGyy7bP1zkL4AxT2ZiEEQqgdGUB3GnDsYOthGa154i8QEsiUBrQPxlbcImsM_6YJ0F0J6Yn9xOtTR7VoUsnq0eO8tdCm-4LVOBnqfEsUFd2xXdq4zbcyQK_dejLPl3atw1u7wB5L8DrM-KrjYx-hdqsA86dLfN8_tU_GAXKXB8h9cFwUxgRIwkBZzp40WuD5_gm2dOnqZt4yCyabEc7CWNbY3-EBU0WTbsYlRSaVBpFiDEmYs2aD1D6Cw-SdX53YvKpTr8FuSEycl6eUsdqzOjbrGbWXjBotT-r4HVJH0UlRYCeWmm2_TF87Xdra4e2UnWJ1dp2ob_n9qhtNDoiTT7tGSVkpl6cZQ==\",\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Clarifying skill instructions**\\n\\nI'm thinking about proposing clearer \\\"skill/instructions\\\" and ensuring that the cron prompt references the correct path. If the skills aren't available, they won’t auto-load, so I need to confirm the planned changes accurately. It might be a good idea to provide final, concise instructions in Spanish as well. That way, I’m ensuring everything is laid out properly and everyone understands the process. Let's make sure everything is clear!\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"Sí, me parece bien. Muy buena idea.\n\nLo haría así, sin tocar el core inicial:\n\n- Crear una skill nueva en `/openclaw/skills/safe/daily-log-summary/`\n- Que genere cada mañana a las **09:00 Europe/Madrid** un resumen del día anterior:\n  - errores/fallos\n  - acciones correctas\n  - riesgos o señales raras\n  - cambios importantes\n  - recomendaciones prudentes\n- Programar un cron diario que la ejecute.\n- Redactar secretos/tokens/credenciales si aparecen en logs.\n- Enviarte el resumen por Telegram.\n\nPero como esto implica **crear archivos y programar una tarea**, necesito confirmación explícita por seguridad.\n\nRespóndeme algo como:\n\n**CONFIRMO: crea la subskill daily-log-summary y programa el resumen diario a las 09:00.**","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0fc5d892c7d3fbf20169ff4714ea04819182a4607998b52701\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.5","usage":{"input":4167,"output":692,"cacheRead":22528,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":27387,"cost":{"input":0.020835000000000003,"output":0.02076,"cacheRead":0.011264,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.052859}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1778337544978,"responseId":"resp_0fc5d892c7d3fbf20169ff47092ce48191abb7de83bf4c6c6a"}}
