MOwM2Wv5qSwoMSGe4H2Ry7odTZMtrdiTgK0eqfi67zCvTiNuP0za-Utir-4NWntadTOq2ChI40SY9kR4tBvCdYusiX4XOefOSGHox4y4Up6c3vl5xVh-j2PwEDwa7ZEJUuITwzLOcPBac_5-v1DylAnrZLe4A==\",\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Considering user preferences**\\n\\nI want to provide supportive responses, especially since the user mentioned a health condition. It seems prudent to do a memory search to see if I have any related preferences stored. Since this is new information, I might consider updating my memory. It's important to ensure I don't give medical advice, but I can offer general caution if needed. I think I should check in with the user about whether they want me to remember this detail.\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"No te disculpes. Gracias por decírmelo.\n\nCon espondilitis anquilosante axial tiene todo el sentido que estés cuidando la rutina: constancia, movilidad suave y no forzar suelen ser claves. Yo puedo ayudarte a llevarlo de forma segura: recordatorios, registro de dolor/rigidez, adaptar rutinas, o preparar un resumen para comentar con tu fisio/reuma.\n\nSolo marco el límite prudente: no sustituyo a tu médico/fisio, y si hay dolor agudo, pérdida de fuerza/sensibilidad, fiebre, dolor torácico raro o empeoramiento fuerte, mejor parar y consultar.\n\n¿Quieres que recuerde que tienes espondilitis anquilosante axial para tenerlo en cuenta en futuras rutinas?","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0fc5d892c7d3fbf20169ff4e83ce888191a72a5786d70b6a23\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.5","usage":{"input":801,"output":235,"cacheRead":28160,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":29196,"cost":{"input":0.004005000000000001,"output":0.00705,"cacheRead":0.014079999999999999,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.025134999999999998}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1778339455232,"responseId":"resp_0fc5d892c7d3fbf20169ff4e7ffd9c819193687f0f022da4e1"}}
